            "detailed_description": "Fly on a magic carpet through the mystical land of Bazaar, collecting exotic trinkets for your journey! Beware dart traps, sea cobras, and hungry crocs that lurk around corners. Vandal monkeys have stolen relics from the guardian of the labyrinth - will you recover them in time or be trapped forever?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSteer with your eyes and consult the constellations to navigate this multi-award winning game made by developers that created indie hits Plants vs. Zombies and Cannon Brawl.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n25+ collectible items, with unique abilities<br />\r\n10+ traps and enemies <br />\r\nEver-changing labyrinths <br />\r\nExtensively designed for player comfort",
